:"https://api.github.com/users/climba03003/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/climba03003/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/climba03003/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/climba03003/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/climba03003/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/climba03003/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2022-01-14T10:56:24Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":5894027612,"node_id":"SE_lADOBCRpgs5B2ZtHzwAAAAFfT7lc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastify/fastify/issues/events/5894027612","actor":{"login":"RafaelGSS","id":26234614,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MjM0NjE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26234614?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelGSS","html_url":"https://github.com/RafaelGSS","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelGSS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelGSS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelGSS/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelGSS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelGSS/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelGSS/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelGSS/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelGSS/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelGSS/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2022-01-14T10:56:24Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastify/fastify/issues/comments/1013710515","html_url":"https://github.com/fastify/fastify/issues/3620#issuecomment-1013710515","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastify/fastify/issues/3620","id":1013710515,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBCRpgs48a_6z","user":{"login":"darkgl0w","id":31093081,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDkzMDgx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31093081?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkgl0w","html_url":"https://github.com/darkgl0w","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkgl0w/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkgl0w/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkgl0w/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkgl0w/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkgl0w/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkgl0w/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkgl0w/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkgl0w/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkgl0w/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-01-15T16:20:37Z","updated_at":"2022-01-15T16:44:29Z","body":"Hello.\r\nThank you for reporting this with a reproducible example @anttti 👍 \r\n\r\nI tried to define the `preHandler` hook in the shorthand route option like this and it highlighted more unwanted breaking changes introduced by the aforementioned PR.\r\n```ts\r\nimport type {\r\n  FastifyPluginAsync,\r\n  preHandlerAsyncHookHandler,\r\n  RawReplyDefaultExpression,\r\n  RawRequestDefaultExpression,\r\n  RawServerBase,\r\n} from \"fastify\";\r\nimport { RouteGenericInterface } from \"fastify/types/route\";\r\n\r\ninterface TestRoute extends RouteGenericInterface {\r\n  readonly Reply: { ok: boolean };\r\n}\r\n\r\n// A hook that does nothing, just to demonstrate the issue with the types\r\nconst myHook: preHandlerAsyncHookHandler<\r\n  RawServerBase,\r\n  RawRequestDefaultExpression<RawServerBase>,\r\n  RawReplyDefaultExpression<RawServerBase>,\r\n  {}\r\n> = async (_req, _res) => undefined;\r\n\r\nconst testRoutes: FastifyPluginAsync = (instance) => {\r\n  // An error here:\r\n  // No overload matches this call.\r\n  //   The last overload gave the following error.\r\n  //     Argument of type '\"preHandler\"' is not assignable to parameter of type '\"onClose\"'.\r\n  instance.addHook(\"preHandler\", myHook);\r\n\r\n  instance.route<TestRoute>({\r\n    method: \"GET\",\r\n    url: \"/\",\r\n    preHandler: myHook, // will trigger the error below\r\n    handler: async (_req, res) => res.send({ ok: true }),\r\n  });\r\n\r\n  return Promise.resolve();\r\n};\r\n\r\nexport default testRoutes;\r\n\r\n```\r\nHere is the error I got from typescript :\r\n```ts\r\n(property) RouteShorthandOptions<Server, IncomingMessage, ServerResponse, TestRoute, unknown, unknown>.preHandler?: preHandlerHookHandler<Server, IncomingMessage, ServerResponse, TestRoute, unknown> | preHandlerHookHandler<Server, IncomingMessage, ServerResponse, TestRoute, unknown>[] | undefined\r\n\r\nType 'preHandlerAsyncHookHandler<RawServerBase, IncomingMessage | Http2ServerRequest, ServerResponse | Http2ServerResponse, {}, unknown>' is not assignable to type 'preHandlerHookHandler<Server, IncomingMessage, ServerResponse, TestRoute, unknown> | preHandlerHookHandler<Server, IncomingMessage, ServerResponse, TestRoute, unknown>[] | undefined'.\r\n  Type 'preHandlerAsyncHookHandler<RawServerBase, IncomingMessage | Http2ServerRequest, ServerResponse | Http2ServerResponse, {}, unknown>' is not assignable to type 'preHandlerHookHandler<Server, IncomingMessage, ServerResponse, TestRoute, unknown>'.\r\n    The 'this' types of each signature are incompatible.\r\n      Type 'FastifyInstance<Server, IncomingMessage, ServerResponse, FastifyLoggerInstance>' is not assignable to type 'FastifyInstance<RawServerBase, IncomingMessage | Http2ServerRequest, ServerResponse | Http2ServerResponse, FastifyLoggerInstance>'.\r\n        The types returned by 'after()' are incompatible between these types.\r\n          Type 'FastifyInstance<Server, IncomingMessage, ServerResponse, FastifyLoggerInstance> & PromiseLike<...>' is not assignable to type 'FastifyInstance<RawServerBase, IncomingMessage | Http2ServerRequest, ServerResponse | Http2ServerResponse, FastifyLoggerInstance> & PromiseLike<...>'.\r\n            Type 'FastifyInstance<Server, IncomingMessage, ServerResponse, FastifyLoggerInstance> & PromiseLike<...>' is not assignable to type 'FastifyInstance<RawServerBase, IncomingMessage | Http2ServerRequest, ServerResponse | Http2ServerResponse, FastifyLoggerInstance>'.\r\n              Types of property 'register' are incompatible.\r\n                Type 'FastifyRegister<FastifyInstance<Server, IncomingMessage, ServerResponse, FastifyLoggerInstance> & PromiseLike<...>>' is not assignable to type 'FastifyRegister<FastifyInstance<RawServerBase, IncomingMessage | Http2ServerRequest, ServerResponse | Http2ServerResponse, FastifyLoggerInstance> & PromiseLike<...>>'.\r\n                  Type 'FastifyInstance<Server, IncomingMessage, ServerResponse, FastifyLoggerInstance> & PromiseLike<...>' is not assignable to type 'FastifyInstance<RawServerBase, IncomingMessage | Http2ServerRequest, ServerResponse | Http2ServerResponse, FastifyLoggerInstance> & PromiseLike<...>'.\r\n                    Type 'FastifyInstance<Server, IncomingMessage, ServerResponse, FastifyLoggerInstance> & PromiseLike<...>' is not assignable to type 'FastifyInstance<RawServerBase, IncomingMessage | Http2ServerRequest, ServerResponse | Http2ServerResponse, FastifyLoggerInstance>'.\r\n                      The types of 'addSchema(...).getDefaultRoute' are incompatible between these types.\r\n                        Type 'DefaultRoute<IncomingMessage, ServerResponse>' is not assignable to type 'DefaultRoute<IncomingMessage | Http2ServerRequest, ServerResponse | Http2ServerResponse>'.\r\n                          Type 'IncomingMessage | Http2ServerRequest' is not assignable to type 'IncomingMessage'.\r\n                            Type 'Http2ServerRequest' is not assignable to type 'IncomingMessage'.ts(2322)\r\nroute.d.ts(43, 3): The expected type comes from property 'preHandler' which is declared here on type 'RouteOptions<Server, IncomingMessage, ServerResponse, TestRoute, unknown, FastifySchema>'\r\n```\r\n\r\n@anttti > As a temporary workaround you must surround your hook definitions with `OmitThisParameter<...>`, in your case :\r\n```ts\r\n// Here is a workaround :\r\nconst myHook: OmitThisParameter<preHandlerAsyncHookHandler<\r\n  RawServerBase,\r\n  RawRequestDefaultExpression<RawServerBase>,\r\n  RawReplyDefaultExpression<RawServerBase>,\r\n  {}\r\n>> = async (_req, _res) => undefined;\r\n\r\n// Another one would be to define your hook like this:\r\nconst myHook: preHandlerAsyncHookHandler = async (_req, _res) => undefined;\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe PR https://github.com/fastify/fastify/pull/3143 seems to have introduced some hidden breaking changes and it seems to have an impact on the typescript fastify users. 😢\r\n\r\n@mcollina > can you transfer this issue to the fastify repo please ?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastify/fastify/issues/comments/1013710515/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"darkgl0w","id":31093081,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDkzMDgx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31093081?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkgl0w","html_url":"https://github.com/darkgl0w","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkgl0w/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkgl0w/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkgl0w/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkgl0w/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkgl